{"id": "742401616275046450", "channel_id": "736052549001674884", "author": "Noki Doki", "author_id": "170141360375070720", "timestamp": "2020-08-10T15:18:58.475000+00:00", "content": "Made some comparisons between the linker maps and some files are version-exclusive: ```\n                              JP 1.0  USA/KOR   PAL    JP 1.1\nEnemy.a enemyinterp.cpp                  x       x       x\nEnemy.a limitkoopa.cpp           x       x\nEnemy.a limitkoopajr.cpp         x       x\nGC2D.a ChangeValue.cpp           x                       x\nJSystem.a JKRFileCache.cpp       x\nJSystem.a JUTDbPrint.cpp         x\nMoveBG.a MapObjTumblePole.cpp    x\nPlayer.a Atom.cpp                x```", "reply_to": null, "attachments": [], "reactions": []}
