{"id": "743929182517461014", "channel_id": "736052549001674884", "author": "Noki Doki", "author_id": "170141360375070720", "timestamp": "2020-08-14T20:28:58.648000+00:00", "content": "Maybe useful:\n- There are only 5 occurrences of `stmw` with a first parameter higher than `r27`, and they’re all in JSystem\n- According to this doc, `use_lmw_stmw` is off by default https://www.nxp.com.cn/docs/en/reference-manual/PA_Build_RM.pdf", "reply_to": null, "attachments": [], "reactions": []}
